  unitName: Azure Blade Lucina
  unitId: 20363
  unitNumber: 533
  description: A knight sworn to the Sama Kingdom, she was raised alone by her navy
    general father. At a young age, she was treated as a freak by others for her
    inability to control her innate magical powers. Though quiet and introverted,
    thanks to her father's training, her skills with the sword were rumored to eclipse
    even those of her dear friend Selena. Though she usually accepted Selena and
    her father's harsh words without a peep, on occasion she is said to have the
    mouth of a sailor.
  summonDesc: No need to chit-chat.<br>I'm here to do my job.<br>Not be your pal.
  fusionDesc: Practice makes perfect.<br>Anybody should know that.<br>But few seem
    to.
